@startuml
title Digidoclocker State Transition Diagram

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state Registration
state CitizenLogin
state RegistrarLogin
state CitizenDashboard
state CertificateApplication
state CertificateVerification
state SessionEnd

Idle --> Registration : New User / Start Registration
Registration --> CitizenLogin : Registration Complete / Submit Details
CitizenLogin --> Idle : Incorrect Credentials / Display Error
CitizenLogin --> CitizenDashboard : Correct Credentials / Authenticate

Idle --> RegistrarLogin : Registrar Login / Enter Credentials
RegistrarLogin --> Idle : Incorrect Credentials / Display Error
RegistrarLogin --> CertificateVerification : Correct Credentials / Authenticate

CitizenDashboard --> CertificateApplication : Apply for Certificate / Initiate Application
CitizenDashboard --> Idle : Logout / End Session
CertificateApplication --> CitizenDashboard : Application Submitted / Return to Dashboard

CertificateVerification --> RegistrarLogin : Request Certificate / Initiate Verification
CertificateVerification --> Idle : Logout / End Session

SessionEnd --> Idle : Timeout / User Initiated Logout

@enduml
